/P 49 0 R
/E (This portfolio represents part ofmy journey as a student of Building Engineering and Architecture: a journey guided by curiosity, responsibility and attention to issues of sustainability and the social impact of architectural design. I believe in architecture as a concrete tool for improving the quality of cities, spaces and the relationships of its users, through simple, conscious and well-constructed solutions. I am motivated to join a firm where I can learn on the job, contribute seriously and grow within a collaborative design process. I bring with me method, adaptability and a strong willingness to get involved: qualities that I have developed both in my studies and in my work and community service experiences. I would be happy to discuss my work in person and explore how I can make a concrete contribution to your projects.)
/Pg 15 0 R
